// Skipstream primary: burst revolver. 9-round clip, 2 damage per pellet.
// NOTE: true 3-round burst grouping (0.13s intra-burst, 0.75s between bursts)
// has no native fire-mode in this weapon system; v1 approximates with a fast
// semi-auto (0.13s fireRate). Burst-grouping fidelity is a deferred fire-mode
// item (playtest).
